  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Both in game and on the website, in the past couple weeks I've had to login when I start the game or use the website uncommonly often compared to what it's been in the past.  I live with one other person who has no access to my computer, so this change has been a nuisance and waste of time for me, and I didn't see anything announced that would make this seem like an intentional change.",
